      "text": {
        "hi": "दो शब्द मिलकर एक नया शब्द: land + slide = landslide, fire + wood = firewood, axe + men = axemen। इन्हें compound words कहते हैं।",
        "hinglish": "Do shabd milkar ek naya shabd: land + slide = landslide, fire + wood = firewood, axe + men = axemen. Inhe compound words kehte hain.",
        "en": "Two words make one new word: land + slide = landslide, fire + wood = firewood. These are compound words."
      }
    },
